# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Environment — `.env.example` is committed, real values are not.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# `.env.production` is committed on purpose: every VITE_ value is inlined into the
# public bundle, so none of it is secret, and CI has no other way to learn the
# production API host. Nothing secret may ever be added to it.
!.env.production

